{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Success</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Climb from zero to the top of success!</strong><br>Work, study, start businesses, invest, and compete with others to build your dream life in a unique clicker game about the real world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Success:\u00a0</strong>is a desktop incremental game where every click brings you closer to your next goal.<br>Start from nothing \u2014 get your first job, open your first business, invest in stocks and bonds, and manage your time and resources to achieve true financial freedom.<br><br>\ud83d\udd11 Game features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfe2 <strong>Work</strong> \u2014 earn money by working multiple jobs at once. Manage your energy and plan your day efficiently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcbb <strong>Freelance</strong> \u2014 work on flexible projects, earn extra income, and build your independent career.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcbc <strong>Business</strong> \u2014 invest in startups, upgrade your ventures, and watch your profit grow \u2014 or lose part of your investment if the market turns against you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcda <strong>Education</strong> \u2014 take courses, develop new skills, and unlock advanced professions and opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc8 <strong>Stocks &amp; Bonds</strong> \u2014 trade on the stock market or buy government bonds with different yields and maturities to secure long-term profit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfe6 <strong>Bank</strong> \u2014 take loans or make deposits. Manage your assets like a true financial strategist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb2 <strong>Lottery</strong> \u2014 take a risk and try your luck with tickets of different rarity and chances to win big!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 <strong>Energy &amp; Resources</strong> \u2014 balance between studying, working, resting, and entertainment to stay productive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd16 <strong>Competition</strong> \u2014 grow your wealth and compete with virtual players who also build their fortunes. Can you become the richest among them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80 <strong>The Path to Success</strong> \u2014 from a broke dreamer to a millionaire investor and business magnate.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc65 <strong>Who is this game for?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Fans of clickers and incremental games who enjoy steady progress and smart management.<br>\u2705 Players who love economy, investment, and life simulation mechanics.<br>\u2705 Those who want to relax but still feel a sense of growth and accomplishment.<br>\u2705 Anyone who believes that success is built one step \u2014 or one click \u2014 at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4012140?t=1760731041","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012140/91713cbd5ac7b8be9afe7e5c8384eb1a458e6ac8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760731041","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012140/d639f76234b78438158cab05f7668c5100419a5e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760731041","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012140/d639f76234b78438158cab05f7668c5100419a5e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760731041","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Success</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>